1
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,800
(Let it go.)

2
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:45,946
=Revenge From A Wife=

3
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:48,306
=Episode 16=

4
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:52,600
Concubine Yu.

5
00:00:57,799 --> 00:00:59,399
Greetings, Your Highness.

6
00:01:01,159 --> 00:01:01,840
Concubine Yu?

7
00:01:02,479 --> 00:01:03,880
You're still recovering.

8
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,039
How did you end up here?

9
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:07,119
I was only a little late.

10
00:01:07,119 --> 00:01:08,240
How did you get so lost?

11
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:09,920
It's my fault.

12
00:01:10,719 --> 00:01:13,200
I meant to find you at Chuying Palace.

13
00:01:13,879 --> 00:01:15,079
But the palace paths twist and turn.

14
00:01:15,519 --> 00:01:16,560
I kept getting farther off course.

15
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:21,359
Your Highness.

16
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:24,120
Noble Lady Hui and I planned to meet.

17
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:25,760
She's been ill with a cold.

18
00:01:26,239 --> 00:01:27,760
I have an old remedy for it

19
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:28,920
and asked her to come get it.

20
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:30,439
She's new to the palace

21
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:31,560
and doesn't know her way around.

22
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:33,319
She must have taken a wrong turn.

23
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:35,040
I see.

24
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:36,920
It's late.

25
00:01:37,239 --> 00:01:38,840
I'll take Noble Lady Hui back with me.

26
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:40,120
We won't disturb your retreat.

27
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:41,159
Hmm.

28
00:01:42,799 --> 00:01:43,879
Since you had plans,

29
00:01:44,599 --> 00:01:45,599
you should head back.

30
00:01:47,879 --> 00:01:48,959
I'll take my leave.

31
00:02:08,879 --> 00:02:11,040
Mufang Pool has a distinct sulfur smell.

32
00:02:11,319 --> 00:02:13,239
Any careful coroner could detect it.

33
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:14,439
Only by burning it

34
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:15,840
can we avoid any future trouble.

35
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,520
Thank you for today, Your Highness.

36
00:02:18,039 --> 00:02:19,919
May I ask why you helped me?

37
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:23,479
Because of the cloth doll.

38
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:27,000
I was the late Empress's personal maid.

39
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:28,520
When she became gravely ill,

40
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:29,879
she wanted to secure my future

41
00:02:30,159 --> 00:02:32,039
and give Zhao someone to rely on,

42
00:02:32,319 --> 00:02:34,080
and asked His Majesty
to grant me a rank.

43
00:02:35,159 --> 00:02:36,240
At Guizhen Cottage,

44
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:38,360
I saw the cloth doll you gave Zhao.

45
00:02:38,919 --> 00:02:39,639
I knew it at once.

46
00:02:40,039 --> 00:02:41,639
An old friend had sewn it.

47
00:02:43,159 --> 00:02:44,680
Nanny Liu once told me

48
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:47,120
someone would help me in the palace.

49
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:48,879
So she meant you.

50
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,319
So...

51
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,560
who are you, really?

52
00:02:52,719 --> 00:02:53,759
Like you,

53
00:02:54,439 --> 00:02:55,479
someone who hates Consort Chen.

54
00:02:57,759 --> 00:02:58,919
So it was all of you.

55
00:02:59,439 --> 00:02:59,840
But...

56
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,599
but that was far too bold of you.

57
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:03,639
You went to great lengths to sneak in

58
00:03:03,879 --> 00:03:06,120
to seek justice that may never come.

59
00:03:06,919 --> 00:03:07,639
Is it worth it?

60
00:03:09,319 --> 00:03:09,919
Justice?

61
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:14,400
I stopped believing in justice long ago.

62
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:15,879
All I want now

63
00:03:16,479 --> 00:03:17,759
is blood for blood.

64
00:03:20,759 --> 00:03:21,360
Your Highness.

65
00:03:22,319 --> 00:03:25,000
Zhao can't spend his life
under his mother's killer's care.

66
00:03:25,439 --> 00:03:27,960
And your child Consort Chen killed

67
00:03:28,639 --> 00:03:30,319
shouldn't have died for nothing.

68
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:31,840
Your Highness.

69
00:03:32,719 --> 00:03:34,199
Do you dare join me

70
00:03:35,439 --> 00:03:36,879
and drag them into the abyss?

71
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:52,319
I've had nothing left to lose
for a long time.

72
00:03:53,159 --> 00:03:54,319
Thank you for today, Your Highness.

73
00:03:55,039 --> 00:03:56,080
It's getting late.

74
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,560
This time,

75
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,879
it's my turn to make a move.

76
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:06,240
I reserved that place just for Roujia.

77
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,240
Who did she think she was

78
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:10,560
to defile it?

79
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:15,439
Others may see it as just a hot spring.

80
00:04:16,280 --> 00:04:17,840
But only I know

81
00:04:18,159 --> 00:04:21,159
that place holds memories
of you and the late Empress.

82
00:04:21,719 --> 00:04:24,600
A place like that
isn't for anyone else to touch.

83
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:30,759
You miss the late Empress deeply.

84
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:32,680
Right now,

85
00:04:33,319 --> 00:04:34,959
you must want some time alone

86
00:04:35,639 --> 00:04:37,319
to talk to her.

87
00:04:39,639 --> 00:04:41,199
I'll take my leave.

88
00:04:49,839 --> 00:04:51,360
You understand me best.

89
00:05:07,879 --> 00:05:09,519
His Majesty left Mufang Pool

90
00:05:09,959 --> 00:05:11,879
and went straight to that wretch
at Jiyun Pavilion.

91
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:12,879
Please calm down, Your Highness.

92
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:14,079
Your Highness.

93
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:17,319
I'm not worried about whose quarters
His Majesty visits.

94
00:05:17,839 --> 00:05:19,160
It's Su Cao.

95
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:22,160
She may not be as simple as we thought.

96
00:05:23,879 --> 00:05:24,639
What do you mean?

97
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:26,000
Your Highness, think about it.

98
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,839
Consort Shu may have been foolish,

99
00:05:28,319 --> 00:05:30,519
but not foolish enough
to walk into certain death.

100
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,360
What's even more alarming is this:

101
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:35,199
There wasn't a single flaw
in Su Cao's plan.

102
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:38,120
It's as if she'd planned every step.

103
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,439
Looking back,

104
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:42,439
she doesn't seem to be after his favor.

105
00:05:42,839 --> 00:05:43,759
It seems more like

106
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:45,759
she came for you.

107
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:50,639
Your Highness.

108
00:05:51,879 --> 00:05:52,639
What is it?

109
00:05:53,199 --> 00:05:55,399
Noble Lady Hui
sent something over just now.

110
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,040
She said...

111
00:05:57,839 --> 00:05:59,240
she'd found it on the road.

112
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,240
That's Consort Shu's hairpin.

113
00:06:05,639 --> 00:06:06,399
That wretch.

114
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,160
How dare she provoke me?

115
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:09,360
Your Highness.

116
00:06:09,759 --> 00:06:11,360
Su Cao has His Majesty's favor now.

117
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,720
We shouldn't act rashly again.

118
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,279
As for Consort Shu,

119
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:15,560
we'll have to let this go for now

120
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:16,759
and plan our next move carefully.

121
00:06:17,279 --> 00:06:18,079
Let it go?

122
00:06:18,839 --> 00:06:20,319
If you're right

123
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:22,240
and she's really after me,

124
00:06:22,839 --> 00:06:23,920
then she can't be allowed to live.

125
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:28,160
Consort Shu is dead and can't testify.

126
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,480
Nothing can be traced back to me.

127
00:06:31,199 --> 00:06:32,439
So I may as well

128
00:06:32,439 --> 00:06:34,120
go to His Majesty and accuse Su Cao.

129
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:35,639
I'll say...

130
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,040
Consort Shu

131
00:06:37,439 --> 00:06:39,800
was lured to Mufang Pool by her

132
00:06:40,519 --> 00:06:42,160
and killed to silence her.

133
00:06:46,053 --> 00:06:47,080
(Treasures of Heaven and Earth)

134
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:47,920
Roujia.

135
00:06:50,519 --> 00:06:51,360
Roujia.

136
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:54,279
Your Majesty.

137
00:06:54,839 --> 00:06:55,720
Why are you here?

138
00:06:59,879 --> 00:07:00,720
Roujia.

139
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:06,519
I've missed you so much.

140
00:07:09,519 --> 00:07:10,319
Your Majesty.

141
00:07:11,279 --> 00:07:14,240
I know I could never compare
to the late Empress.

142
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:18,360
But Che, I can't bear to see

143
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:20,360
you hurting like this.

144
00:07:21,199 --> 00:07:23,319
Even if you mistake me for her tonight,

145
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,600
I'm willing.

146
00:07:30,079 --> 00:07:30,920
Su.

147
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:33,959
I'm sorry.

148
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,639
You don't have to be anyone else.

149
00:07:38,639 --> 00:07:40,319
Because you're you.

150
00:08:12,729 --> 00:08:16,916
♪Sunset fades beyond the lonely city♪

151
00:08:17,050 --> 00:08:20,663
♪Dusk snow paints the green hills♪

152
00:08:20,898 --> 00:08:23,497
♪A lone rider storms the old pass♪

153
00:08:23,534 --> 00:08:25,814
♪Drunk, I gaze by lamplight♪

154
00:08:25,861 --> 00:08:29,690
♪Old friends have all drifted away♪

155
00:08:30,092 --> 00:08:33,445
♪My broken sword rusts, as do I♪

156
00:08:34,372 --> 00:08:37,885
♪Jackdaws cry into the night♪

157
00:08:38,385 --> 00:08:40,952
♪Half a banner snaps in the wind♪

158
00:08:41,078 --> 00:08:43,111
♪In dreams, I return to the camps♪

159
00:08:43,178 --> 00:08:46,955
♪Moonlight chills my armor♪

160
00:08:47,305 --> 00:08:51,638
♪Life is a dream through many winters♪

161
00:08:51,861 --> 00:08:55,368
♪I gaze beyond the edge of the world♪

162
00:08:55,549 --> 00:08:58,402
♪Parting sorrow spills across the moon♪

163
00:08:58,469 --> 00:09:04,083
♪The moon and wind mean nothing now♪

164
00:09:04,123 --> 00:09:07,137
♪History turns to ash before ink dries♪

165
00:09:07,178 --> 00:09:13,186
♪Who plays the zither
and sighs at the pavilion?♪

166
00:09:13,853 --> 00:09:20,808
♪The past has faded away♪

167
00:09:31,808 --> 00:09:35,840
♪The past has faded away♪
